<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militants and vigilantes clashed with over 100 suspected terrorists in Nigeria's Mariga forest while armed men advanced toward vulnerable Miango communities, and bandits killed farmer Malam Musa Dogo and his son Uzaifa in Niger. Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were observed operating in Mali and Russia helped foil a coup in Niger, prompting EU concern about Algerian and Russian forces in Niger. The conflict continues to produce high fatalities, with 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOTDZVM2c0aDVFZzYtWm91dUV4Q3RzcHNuaEVUVDlyRFRfSHNuUmRIWGxHdDZIWEJ3WUZJR0RGWC1FXzlUZGJGVFh3aVF0TWRsb1QxLUk3djRYdmNSOTBRTTNaY3YyWDc3YmVNYzRONkgxVndnVnlBVHRIWjRuRGpmVGtXbms2aDNfTzFiY3EwVGJhVTQza1ZnR1VMWWw4X3FpRGd1OF9oX1pjU3BRVFFWYk9Gc3AzR0RW?oc=5&quot;&gt;YSscores&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPcHpBM05XMExveE5EVktNVThfN2N6VU5Vb09FYmhPZnlEVXhUTS0zeTAxa0V6YzFpeHdoTUlaUHZBdEFKNmtkVThBRDltQXpSMFpyOWRzQkhSR2RRXzNodno3WllGdlJxTjdOZ0wwYy10dUxScHRUTzFGZ3NuME5jNDd6R0hkazR2TXBxUjhPTDAzWmhzYnRPckhadHlhRG5ieHdhcHJkSzFoUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPWlFIS3k2XzBSZFZtMFgtLVFpSVR1SUt6WWIzWTh3c0JvMU1TblpwcHJoTTU0V2JDaTNLYmFuNTJpd3RCOGw2bWV2YUpLTEZ2U2hNTmRTUFI3OUFYUVFKSlB3S0xoZkJ5VE92S1VZc2plU25TUU5xbnZUWndvRkVCdzFQODl2YjJOeUc4TGl4R2pGZXUzcEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNN19lOEpTNUxWZm1QMnFXMzJPd3Z1eXVSblhWcnlsZHMxZ1N6cTV1S3p0ejNFMmJHWGJTMnItV2xhR0ZhalBacGZ1aFV0T3JHYkN0OTVJMGE2dFFzTzg1WE9BakhEeHpDZC1RNGpKZ1BqRmNIeGZ1S3llSEg2ZmxCcTlEMTdNb0djbzJV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxO